# UI/UX for BingeWatcher

Read `DESIGN.md` for the source of truth. When editing Vue/CSS:

## Must keep
- Fonts: Syne (display/wordmark), Figtree (body) — never Inter/Roboto/Bebas as primary
- Light canvas `#f5f5f3`, ink CTAs, quiet green accent `#3d6b5a`
- Soft wordmark — modest Syne, not oversized marquee titles
- Brand-first but calm Discover: short label + headline + support + search

## Patterns
- Genre chips: outline, accent when active
- List detail: Watching / Want / Watched / Unsorted with typography-led headers
- Poster `+` (ink) → check (accent) when already in a list
- Recommendations use the same `PosterCard` grid language
- Hairline borders, more whitespace, `max-w-6xl`

## Avoid
- Dark cinema theme, gold IMDb accents, purple SaaS gradients
- Nested cards, pill-heavy nav, shouty uppercase gold eyebrows
- Surprising “already added” errors — surface membership first
